{"parse": {"title": "命运的雨季-03", "pageid": 123675, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-02\" title=\"命运的雨季-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">命运的雨季-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-04\" title=\"命运的雨季-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">命运的雨季</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B0.B4.E6.99.B6.E7.9A.84.E7.BC.9D.E9.9A.99\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"水晶的缝隙\">水晶的缝隙</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 水晶的缝隙</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Cracks and Splinters</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zongmaolaozhaitingyuan\"><img alt=\"zongmaolaozhaitingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png/600px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png/900px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一处坐落在德里郊区的庭院。人迹罕至，静谧得似乎让太阳都冷了几度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>虽然贝丽尔女士需要在僻静的地方休养，但——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>这也太偏僻了！真的会有人来这里买水晶吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从热闹的宝石贸易街离开的宝石猎人，不由感叹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走向廊道尽头的偏屋，隐约听见屋内交谈的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304127.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304127.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……所以在摩卢旁卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敞开的门内，一个活泼的小姑娘正在贝丽尔身前滔滔不绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女听见门外传来的动静，转过身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>噢，你就是妈妈说的能鉴别真伪的宝石猎人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一张与贝丽尔乍看相似，细看截然不同的稚嫩面庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>原来贝丽尔女士……真的有女儿。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这股充沛的天体能量十分罕见，玛蒂尔达决不能错过这个机会！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>嗯，占卜师也需领悟天体运行这门晦涩的象征语言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师间的交谈尚未结束。灰调蓝也不愿打扰母女间的重逢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一边为贝丽尔整理着还未来得及收好的水晶，一边观察着占卜师作为母亲的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你认为借助星体的能量，真的能让你看清未来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔，天体的相位变化是宇宙与人类命运的镜像状态……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>玛蒂尔达，去了基金会后，命运对你而言意味着什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>是月光洒下的角度吗？还是水晶球里显现的实相？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这场对话里，占卜师罕见地向少女抛出了质疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰调蓝停下手中的动作，回头看了看玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩显露出与自己一样的不解和犹豫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>不，那只是命运最浅薄的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>命运为我们提供指引，它缜密，却需要以灵性领悟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>但我相信，世上所有征兆都是通向命运的一环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师微笑着不发一言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈，怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>不，没什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我很庆幸，你还和从前一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>从你要求转学开始，你的选择仍然依照命运的指示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔似乎又恢复了之前的态度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>啊哈！布翁尼女士，这是一位占卜师向另一位占卜师发起的考验，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>自然，你通过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看着玛蒂尔达兴高采烈的模样，灰调蓝忧虑地皱了皱眉。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>如今在贸易街上流通的蓝宝石，大多是赝品。我打算直接去矿区寻找。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达走后，灰调蓝才有机会向贝丽尔交代她接下来的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在巴黎的最后时刻，宝石猎人与占卜师达成了合作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如今，为了珍贵的喀什米尔蓝宝石，二人的旅途行至德里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>嗯，那便辛苦你跑一趟吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>怎么了，阿黛拉？还有什么是需要告知我的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您刚才是真心夸赞玛蒂尔达吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我认为我表达得很清楚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉，拿上这颗水晶球吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-313410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-313410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-313410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>比起通讯器，水晶传信在矿区里会更稳定一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>有任何紧急情况，我们也能及时联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师露出一个柔和的笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰调蓝接过水晶球，明白占卜师已不愿多谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……好。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个月后，“雨”再次溯流而上，狂热的波普艺术随雨舞蹈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安全屋内，灰调蓝有些愣怔地看着贝丽尔忙碌的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几乎以灰调蓝的生命为代价寻来的蓝宝石，如今被贝丽尔摆放在桌面中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>……你怎么还是这个表情？我以为你从矿区回来后就做好了心理准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>逃离死亡的费利西安，成为了寄居在矿物里虚弱的幽灵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有为她施法的占卜师和与她共生的宝石猎人才能听到她的言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……那我得像贝丽尔女士那样，永远处事不惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>不管面对什么也不会动摇自己的内心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗外的“雨”下得更大了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与此同时，占卜师落座。她的手覆上矿物，仪式的辉光渐次亮起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我只是希望，这次贝丽尔女士的仪式能成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>这样所有人的付出才会有意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安全屋内耀如白昼，所有矿物持续嗡鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰调蓝眯着眼，艰难地注视着贝丽尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-313521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-313521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-313521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔女士究竟……看到了什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>答案暂时远去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喀什米尔蓝宝石到达了承受的极点，猛地炸开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>矿物的残片溅落在地面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>又失败了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔一动不动地坐着，垂着眼，思忖了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>仪式比上一次持续得更久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>但这依旧不是那颗最合适的矿石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝宝石最后的价值也化为了乌有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您从来没有正面回答过这个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但此刻，请告诉我，您究竟想要通过这场仪式看到什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔沉默着。半晌，她望了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉，在这段时间里，你获得了想要的“真相”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……“暴雨”扰乱了世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>时代超出限度的紊乱将会让它在某一时刻降临……就像当初在巴黎那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>在它停下之前，我们无法预测我们将回到哪里，这件事甚至超越了您的能力范畴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>那么，你的结论是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提问者与回答者的身份交换。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知为何，眼前的情景，让她体会到强烈的既视感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她坚定了自己的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>“暴雨”让生活失去了所有意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔轻笑了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰调蓝终于想了起来，这一幕曾在哪里上演——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不久前那场贝丽尔与玛蒂尔达之间的对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>贝丽尔，你究竟在不高兴些什么？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "命运的雨季-03"}}